				"Reference image 1: Shen Yanqiu, East Asian woman, 38 to 42 years old, black hair in a neat low bun, oval face with calm composed dark brown eyes, light gray ribbed turtleneck sweater under a dark gray wool blazer, black tailored trousers, silver chain-link bracelet on the left wrist, plain silver band ring on the left ring finger. Reference image 2: Lin Wan, East Asian woman, 28 to 33 years old, long black hair in a loose messy bun with stray strands framing the face, soft oval face, gentle resilient dark brown eyes, small nose, soft lips, oatmeal V-neck loose knit long dress, chunky silver chain-link ring. Reference image 3, background: contemporary art gallery hall at afternoon, clean white walls, at the far wall one large painting of two intertwined bare branches extending upward against a dark background with roots entwined at the bottom, warm track spotlights on ceiling rails, high window at the left with soft daylight, polished concrete floor with warm reflections, two wooden benches, potted green plants. Audio contains only spoken Chinese dialogue and positive diegetic ambience.\nMedium two-shot with opposing three-quarter profiles, the two women facing each other before the painting in Reference image 3. 0 to 3 seconds, the woman in Reference image 1 hands over a cup of warm water, saying in a low warm voice, \"来看你. 布展累不累?\" 3 to 6 seconds, the woman in Reference image 2 takes the cup, fingertips naturally touching hers, no flinching, only a warm response, eyes softening. 6 to 10 seconds, Lin Wan says with a light reminiscent smile, \"还行. 只是突然想起, 三年前你第一次来画廊, 也是站在这个位置. 那时候我连对视都不敢.\" Her gaze settling on Shen Yanqiu's left ring finger. Audio contains soft gallery ambience, cup handover, cloth rustle, and spoken Chinese dialogue."
